# ── SAR Flood Safe-Haven Platform (Dancing with the SARs) ───────────────
# NASA Space Apps Challenge Dual-Perspective Flood Platform
#
# Primary Path (Offline Demo): No credentials required. The entire application,
# routing engine, and globe visualizer run from pre-processed /data/nepal/* files.
#
# Secondary Path (Live Sentinel-1 SAR via Google Earth Engine):
# Set GEE credentials if you wish to run `python sar-pipeline/gee_sar_update.py`
# against live Copernicus Sentinel-1 GRD IW VV imagery and Copernicus GLO-30 DEM.
#
# GEE_PROJECT_ID=your-google-cloud-project-id
# GEE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=your-service-account@your-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com
# GEE_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH=/path/to/private-key.json

